        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Round wood, softwood, debarked, u=70% at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Round wood, softwood, debarked, u=70% at forest road
The  volume refers to the wood not including the bark. The multi-output process "debarking, softwood, in forest" delivers the two coproducts "round wood, softwood, debarked, u=70% at forest road" and "bark chips, softwood, u=140%, at forest road". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: ce0a4c63-e839-3e07-b7cc-3c2044709b02
Tractor driven debarking; allocation based on proceeds
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Referes to a tractor driven process.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Germany is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ce0a4c63-e839-3e07-b7cc-3c2044709b02.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
